1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,250
Ceng Niu,

25
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,250
if you kill me,

26
00:02:17,240 --> 00:02:19,490
the country of Suzaku won't let that slide !

27
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,570
A genius like you

28
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:24,170
shouldn't be threatening me like that.

29
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,010
Red Butterfly,

30
00:02:26,800 --> 00:02:28,930
didn’t you want to fight me again ?

31
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:37,380
I can't use the Return Cauldron in the overlapping fragments.

32
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,250
If I escape this,

33
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:40,050
I will only be on the second layer.

34
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,410
An Early stage Soul Formation

35
00:02:59,720 --> 00:03:01,130
cannot stop me !

36
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,170
Time !

37
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,450
This is...

38
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,410
a time domain ?

39
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,450
Under normal circumstances,

40
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,090
this unfinished domain

41
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:25,450
wouldn't stand a single blow.

42
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:28,410
But now that I'm injured,

43
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:30,650
he pushed me this far...

44
00:03:33,920 --> 00:03:34,970
Die !

45
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,930
This can't go on !

46
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:53,930
A teleportation artifact of Suzaku ?

47
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:57,130
No wonder she was so confident in the Celestial Realm.

48
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,090
I will remember you, Ceng Niu !

49
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:00,690
Today,

50
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,570
you forced me to give up one level of cultivation

51
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:05,450
to be able to use this bracelet.

52
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,210
But tomorrow,

53
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,690
I will pay you back a hundred times !

54
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,410
I'll see you on planet Suzaku !

55
00:04:12,210 --> 00:04:14,490
Her Emotionless Domain is too strong.

56
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,730
Red Butterfly,

57
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,570
what do you think this is ?

58
00:04:16,600 --> 00:04:18,170
Xue Yue's
Seven Feathered Fan

59
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,410
Senior Sister's fan...

60
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:27,090
Red Butterfly's domain is weakened !

61
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:39,850
You can't escape !

62
00:04:51,840 --> 00:04:53,530
It was so close...

63
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,850
Even if I didn't kill her,

64
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,850
with this arm

65
00:04:58,080 --> 00:05:00,530
I can use countless curses

66
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,610
to ensure that

67
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:06,130
she will forever remain at Soul Formation.

68
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:14,250
What ? It's blocked ?

69
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:22,370
As expected,

70
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:26,010
I can't use the Return Cauldron from here.

71
00:05:26,560 --> 00:05:28,570
There's no way to go back anymore.

72
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,530
Brother Chi Hu

73
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:40,330
Brother Ceng !

74
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,690
It's impossible to return to the second layer.

75
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,250
If we want a chance to survive,

76
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:47,930
we must go to the next layer.

77
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,330
Brother Chi Hu,

78
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:52,050
you and I have the lowest cultivation level.

79
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:53,450
We must work together.

80
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:55,490
Brother Ceng wants to go to the fourth layer ?

81
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,850
But do you know where the entrance is ?

82
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:16,370
Brother Ceng had already prepared for this...

83
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:17,810
According to Zhou Yi,

84
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:21,250
if a single of the 6 overlapping fragments collapses,

85
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:23,630
even if we go to the fourth layer,

86
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:26,410
it's only a matter of time before it collapses too.

87
00:06:26,960 --> 00:06:29,730
The only way to leave this place

88
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:33,010
is with Chi Hu’s star compass.

89
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:38,650
Fourth layer of the
overlapping fragments
Rain Celestial Realm

90
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,650
Is this whole palace

91
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,690
really made of celestial jades ?!

92
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:04,930
The owner of this place must have been important.

93
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:08,850
Zhou Yi,

94
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,090
you madman !

95
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,810
I even returned the corpse to you !

96
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,490
Why don't you just leave me alone ?

97
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:17,890
Zhou Yi,

98
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:20,490
if you burn your Origin Soul like that you will die.

99
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:22,450
Don't try to drag me down with you !

100
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:43,770
You

101
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,650
should be punished

102
00:07:45,880 --> 00:07:47,610
for offending Ting'er.

103
00:07:49,760 --> 00:07:50,810
My head...

104
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,610
hurts so bad...

105
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,130
Ting'er,

106
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,930
after I kill him,

107
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:10,050
we will go into the void, okay ?

108
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,290
If you fight like that,

109
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,090
you will run out sooner or later.

110
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:41,930
I just need to hold on for a moment

111
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:43,770
and you're going to fall apart !

112
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,690
You can't kill me !

113
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,210
Ting'er,

114
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:52,970
something seems to be awakening in my memory...

115
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,770
He's running out of energy...

116
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,930
I'm afraid he won't last long.

117
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:24,210
I won !

118
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,610
Zhou Yi,

119
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:28,850
you were once the pride of the Five Elements Sect.

120
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:31,170
But just for a female corpse,

121
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:34,530
you burned your own Origin Soul.

122
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:40,050
I have been looking for it all my life.

123
00:09:40,280 --> 00:09:42,530
I never thought that in the end,

124
00:09:42,680 --> 00:09:45,010
thanks to my own Origin Soul burning,

125
00:09:45,050 --> 00:09:47,330
I would finally understand…

126
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:57,890
Something

127
00:09:58,640 --> 00:09:59,810
is coming !

128
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,450
What the hell is this ?

129
00:10:26,960 --> 00:10:28,370
Such a powerful force !

130
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,410
So this is

131
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,970
the Dao.

132
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:35,900
Master once told me that those who seek the Dao

133
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:38,890
are willing to die at sunset to find the right path in the morning.

134
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:41,210
So this is what he meant…

135
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:02,770
Zhou Yi
Ascendant Origin Soul

136
00:11:08,520 --> 00:11:09,410
Asc...

137
00:11:09,640 --> 00:11:11,010
Ascendant...

138
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,010
Ting'er,

139
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,930
I remember now...

140
00:11:15,680 --> 00:11:17,410
I remember everything...

141
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:24,730
Young Zhou Yi

142
00:11:20,090 --> 00:11:22,700
Main Hall of the
Five Elements Sect

143
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:20,890
I was born gifted with talent

144
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:24,690
so I became a disciple of the Five Elements Sect thousands of years ago.

145
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:27,690
Everyone in the sect had high hopes for me.

146
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:30,650
They thought I'd become a powerful figure of the cultivation world.

147
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:34,210
On the day I reached Soul Formation,

148
00:11:34,520 --> 00:11:36,730
my master gave me a Rain Cauldron

149
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,930
so that I could try my luck in the Celestial Realm.

150
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,690
In the Celestial Realm,

151
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:45,490
I met you.

152
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:49,690
I thought my obsession came from my love towards you

153
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:52,730
but the truth is that

154
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:56,130
you forced the craze domain onto me.

155
00:11:56,520 --> 00:12:00,330
Just so that I would collect celestial jades to protect your body.

156
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,890
For that purpose,

157
00:12:02,160 --> 00:12:04,330
I stole the sect's celestial jades.

158
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:08,890
My master was furious so he kicked me out of the sect.

159
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:12,970
He then failed to reach Ascendant and died before I could see him again.

160
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:16,330
I was never able

161
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:18,050
to repay his kindness...

162
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:23,410
I secretly saved the Five Elements Sect 3 times,

163
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,530
to seek inner peace.

164
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:29,850
There was no place left for me in this world

165
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:32,090
but I still took you everywhere with me.

166
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:35,890
No matter if they were evil or righteous,

167
00:12:37,880 --> 00:12:39,810
they all rejected me.

168
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:44,450
I went from an ambitious prodigy

169
00:12:44,280 --> 00:12:47,490
to living as a joke in the eyes of everyone.

170
00:12:48,560 --> 00:12:50,370
My domain is craze.

171
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,970
You are my Dao Heart.

172
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:56,210
No one in this world is perfect.

173
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:59,450
I, Zhou Yi, have let down too many people in my life.

174
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:02,290
But the only thing I don't want to do

175
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,890
is to let you down.

176
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:08,430
Even if I have to die,

177
00:13:08,240 --> 00:13:10,170
I will happily do it.

178
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,530
If I were given another chance,

179
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:16,850
I would choose

180
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:19,490
to meet you again.

181
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:28,650
Little Brother,

182
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,810
after I die,

183
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:33,530
help me take care of my wife.

184
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:34,410
Okay ?

185
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:36,970
This...

186
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:39,490
Zhou Yi is famous on planet Suzaku

187
00:13:39,760 --> 00:13:41,240
for this female corpse.

188
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:43,330
I'm afraid it's not going to be easy.

189
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:46,130
If word gets out that I have the corpse,

190
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:49,330
I will be disowned from the clan.

191
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:51,410
But if I anger him...

192
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,690
I'm afraid he...

193
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,650
Junior is willing to do it.

194
00:13:58,920 --> 00:14:01,210
You are the young master of the Giant Demon Clan

195
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:03,210
so it is natural that you would be afraid

196
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,210
to follow my footsteps.

197
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,890
Forget it.

198
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:16,090
Are you willing to help me ?

199
00:14:16,240 --> 00:14:17,810
My wife

200
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:21,850
needs 1000 celestial jades every 1000 years to sustain her body.

201
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:25,050
It's a bit difficult, but manageable.

202
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:26,010
Little Brother,

203
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:27,930
are you willing to help ?

204
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:32,410
I don’t dare to promise that I can obtain that many celestial jades.

205
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,130
I won’t let you help me

206
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,650
for thousands of years for free.

207
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:34,690
This pagoda

208
00:15:34,880 --> 00:15:37,210
contains my Ascendant domain.

209
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:39,170
Place it down

210
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:41,410
and unless someone is above my current cultivation,

211
00:15:41,240 --> 00:15:42,930
they won't be able to pass.

212
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:47,010
Ascendant Crystal

213
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:46,130
This is the first gift I give you,

214
00:15:46,280 --> 00:15:47,850
an Ascendant Crystal.

215
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:50,130
It's useless to you right now,

216
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:53,130
but if one day you are about to reach the Ascendant stage,

217
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,370
then it will help you.

218
00:15:54,440 --> 00:15:55,890
An Ascendant Crystal !

219
00:15:56,080 --> 00:15:59,010
It's formed during an Ascendant breakthrough.

220
00:15:58,880 --> 00:16:00,730
It's no different from your life.

221
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,530
Gifting it unheard of...

222
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:05,050
If I could have it,

223
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:09,210
I would have a hope to reach Ascendant in my life.

224
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:11,290
But...

225
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:14,170
If the first gift is so precious,

226
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:16,210
then what about the second one ?

227
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:17,170
And the third one ?

228
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:21,290
My second gift to you is this person.

229
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:24,130
Head Elder of the Corpse Sect,

230
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:25,450
I can spare your life,

231
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:28,330
but you must become a slave for 1000 years.

232
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:30,250
Are you

233
00:16:30,040 --> 00:16:31,370
willing ?

234
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,010
This...

235
00:16:33,280 --> 00:16:35,570
My life won’t even last another 100 years,

236
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:37,330
so how can I be a slave for 1000 years ?

237
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:40,290
Your lifespan is your own problem.

238
00:16:40,680 --> 00:16:42,570
If you just want to die,

239
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:44,410
then I can help you.

240
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:47,850
With my remaining strength, I can refine you into a weaker puppet.

241
00:16:47,880 --> 00:16:48,930
Easily.

242
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,850
I agree.

243
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:59,370
This slave restriction is extremely clever.

244
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:01,610
With just a single thought,

245
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,810
I can crush the soul

246
00:17:04,280 --> 00:17:06,530
of this Soul Transformation cultivator.

247
00:17:09,120 --> 00:17:11,010
This old slave Sun Tai

248
00:17:10,800 --> 00:17:12,290
greets Master…

249
00:17:12,720 --> 00:17:15,050
A Soul Transformation cultivator as a slave ?

250
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:18,850
With this person in my hands,

251
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:20,410
aside from the country of Suzaku,

252
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,530
I would be able to freely traverse the planet.

253
00:17:24,240 --> 00:17:26,290
Take good care of her.

254
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,290
Master,

255
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:32,290
I was unfilial,

256
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,650
I'm sorry for what I've done to you.

257
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,770
If there is an afterlife,

258
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:39,370
I’m still your disciple…

259
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:45,570
You

260
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:48,130
won't die today.

261
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:08,130
First Rain Celestial Sword,

262
00:18:08,240 --> 00:18:09,090
appear !

263
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:24,810
She...

264
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:27,170
Who the hell is she ?!

265
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:30,170
First Rain Celestial Sword

266
00:18:32,760 --> 00:18:33,890
Is this...

267
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:35,650
a celestial sword ?

268
00:18:44,920 --> 00:18:47,250
You protected me for more than 2000 years,

269
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:48,330
you...

270
00:18:48,600 --> 00:18:49,770
worked hard.

271
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:54,290
I will make you the Sword Spirit of this celestial sword.

272
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:56,210
In 10 000 years,

273
00:18:57,000 --> 00:19:00,210
you will become a Celestial Saint.

274
00:19:01,830 --> 00:21:37,590
Many people claim Zhou Yi had a breakthrough to Ascendant and they are probably right because the novel explicitly said that the Ascendant Crystal he gave to Wang Lin had been just formed.

However, I think that this wasn't an Ascendant breakthrough (or that the Er Gen hadn't figured out yet how to portray an Ascendant breakthrough). Maybe you'll understand what I mean when we see one. Also, the jump from Middle stage Soul Transformation to Ascendant is a bit too much even when considering he burned his Origin Soul. My theory is that he reached Ascendant some time after he became crazy, he hid his Ascendant Crystal and then forgot. His true cultivation was locked behind his memories. Recovering his memory was the key to unlocking his cultivation.
This doesn't really change anything but I wanted to share my thoughts.

"Celestial Saint" here is the only instance of these words in the entire novel and there is no information on what they mean. It doesn't correspond to any celestial cultivation level. I think it may be either an honorific title or Er Gen wrote it as a celestial cultivation level and changed their names later on.

275
00:19:18,440 --> 00:19:25,370
Falling from the night sky and melting into dust
like water without a source.

276
00:19:25,190 --> 00:19:31,530
Like the difference between clouds and mud,
the truth cannot be found in conflict.

277
00:19:31,390 --> 00:19:35,470
Life and death
are like the moment when the rain falls

278
00:19:35,250 --> 00:19:39,400
and like many other unseparable things.

279
00:19:39,510 --> 00:19:45,410
In this lifetime,
to cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.

280
00:19:46,340 --> 00:19:52,420
Old grudges had to be settled
because half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.

281
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:58,270
Use the most vivid love and hate
to ask questions to your fate.

282
00:19:58,480 --> 00:20:02,950
Let your eyes be filled enough with rage
to pierce the heart and the soul

283
00:20:02,960 --> 00:20:06,440
then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.

284
00:20:06,360 --> 00:20:12,430
Only when you bend down can you understand
the hidden edge of the blade.

285
00:20:12,700 --> 00:20:16,630
The human mind is nature,
the rain fell silently like an answer.

286
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:20,550
Life and death are just moments away,
there are many other solutions to grudges.

287
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:26,400
Use your dusty heart
to depict the world.

288
00:20:26,410 --> 00:20:30,330
One stroke is for killing.
After struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.

289
00:20:30,290 --> 00:20:34,110
One stroke is for caring.
Everywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.

290
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:40,150
Give up your mind to be refined
by this endless world.

